  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "カロスちほうから　とおく　はなれた\nばしょで　まもりがみ　とされる\nポケモンを　かたどった　おきもの。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "칼로스지방에서 멀리 떨어진 곳의\n수호신으로 여겨지는\n포켓몬을 본떠 만든 장식품.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ornement à l’image d’un Pokémon vénéré\ncomme protecteur dans une région éloignée\nde Kalos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Skulptur in Form eines Pokémon,\ndas in einer weit von Kalos entfernten Region als\nSchutzpatron angesehen wird.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Statuetta raffigurante un Pokémon che viene\nconsiderato una divinità protettrice in alcuni\nluoghi molto lontani da Kalos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An ornament depicting a Pokémon\nthat is venerated as a protector\nin some region far from Kalos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "カロス地方から　遠く　離れた\n場所で　守り神　とされる\nポケモンを　かたどった　置物。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "アローラちほうで　ふるくから\nまもりがみ　とされる　ふしぎな\nポケモンを　かたどった　おきもの。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "알로라지방에서 예로부터\n수호신으로 여겨지는 신비한\n포켓몬을 본떠 만든 장식품.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "據說是模仿自古以來\n在阿羅拉地區被稱為守護神的\n神奇寶可夢而製作的擺設。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ornement à l’image d’un Pokémon vénéré\nà Alola et considéré comme divinité protectrice\ndepuis des temps immémoriaux.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine Skulptur in Form eines wundersamen Pokémon,\ndas in der Alola-Region seit jeher als Schutzpatron\nangesehen wird.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ornamento que representa a un Pokémon\nmisterioso venerado desde la antigüedad en\nAlola como espíritu protector.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Statuetta raffigurante un Pokémon misterioso\nche ad Alola viene considerato una divinità\nprotettrice sin dall’antichità.",
